    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "A small grid search: two learning rates times two batch sizes, 15 epochs each, scored on the same test split. Each learning rate is one block (a model, its Optimizer, the training run and the test accuracy), placed twice and fed a DataLoader of batch 8 or batch 32. The table ranks the four cells: lr 0.05, batch 8: 0.978; lr 0.05, batch 32: 0.822; lr 0.001, batch 8: 0.667; lr 0.001, batch 32: 0.667. At lr 0.001 neither batch size gets anywhere in 15 epochs. At lr 0.05 batch 8 wins: it takes four times as many optimizer steps per epoch as batch 32, so the step count matters as much as the rate.\n\n小型的網格搜尋：兩個學習率乘以兩個 batch size，各訓練 15 個 epoch，用同一份測試資料評分。每個學習率是一個區塊（模型、它的 Optimizer、訓練與測試正確率），放兩次，分別接 batch 8 與 batch 32 的 DataLoader。表格把四格排名：lr 0.05, batch 8: 0.978; lr 0.05, batch 32: 0.822; lr 0.001, batch 8: 0.667; lr 0.001, batch 32: 0.667。lr 0.001 時，兩種 batch size 在 15 個 epoch 內都沒有進展。lr 0.05 時 batch 8 勝出：每個 epoch 裡它的 optimizer 步數是 batch 32 的四倍，所以步數和學習率一樣重要。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-sweep",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2304,
        "y": -451
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "One run per cell is one seed per cell, so treat close cells as ties (see Five seeds, mean and spread). For a bigger grid, open the Runs tab of the bottom panel and click New sweep: it lists the graph's top-level parameters (a block's insides are not among them, so sweep a flat graph) and queues one run per combination. The Studies button next to it lists studies submitted through POST /api/studies or the Graph Copilot plugin, ranked by mean, standard deviation and count over repeats.\n\n每格只跑一次就是每格只有一個 seed，相近的格子當成平手（見「Five seeds, mean and spread」）。要跑更大的網格，打開下方面板的「執行任務」分頁，按「新增掃描」：它列出圖的頂層參數（區塊內部不在其中，所以要掃描沒有區塊的圖），每個組合排入一次執行。旁邊的 Studies 按鈕列出透過 POST /api/studies 或 Graph Copilot 外掛送出的 study，依重複執行的平均、標準差與次數排名。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "table",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -529
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    }
  ],
